# --- Password reset email (Resend) -----------------------------------------
# Copy this file to ".env.local" and fill in your key.
#
# 1. Sign up (free) at https://resend.com and create an API key.
# 2. Paste it below.
#
# Without a verified domain, Resend (in test mode) only delivers:
#   - FROM: onboarding@resend.dev
#   - TO:   the email address of your own Resend account
# That is enough for a demo. To send to any recipient, verify a domain in
# Resend and update RESET_FROM in src/server/email.ts to an address on it.
#
# If this key is left empty, the app falls back to printing the reset link to
# the server console (and showing it on the confirmation screen) so the flow
# still works during development.
RESEND_API_KEY=
